      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ask the documents\n\nSend a POST to `/webhook/ask-docs` with `{\"question\": \"...\"}`.\n\n1. **Webhook** receives the question\n2. **Ask the RAG project** sends it to the chat server (port 8000) and gets back the answer and its sources\n3. **Send the answer back** returns that answer to whoever asked\n\nThe chat server (`python chat.py`) must be running.",
